.el .ds Aq '
.TH orbit-self-update 1  "self-update " 
.SH NAME
orbit\-self\-update \- Check for and install a verified CLI release
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBorbit self\-update\fR [\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-\-no\-color\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Check for and install a verified CLI release
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-dry\-run\fR
Download and verify the update without replacing this executable
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Print one JSON object per result, with `"v":1`, instead of text
.TP
\fB\-\-no\-color\fR
Disable ANSI colors
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.SH EXTRA
Examples:
  orbit self\-update
  orbit self\-update \-\-dry\-run
